{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/113971-a-jester-kith","id":113971,"title":"A Jester Kith?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Changeling: The Lost"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-04-16T04:52:45-07:00","id":113971,"title":"A Jester Kith?","content":"Have I missed something. Is there a Jester Kith? It would fit with the Wizzened, although I could see both Darklings and certain Beasts useing such a kith as well.<br /> <br /> <br /> Any got Ideas for a Jester Kith if they don't have one?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/857-astromancer","name":"Astromancer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar857_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2195"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-16T05:17:15-07:00","id":113977,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://wodindex.wikispaces.com/Complete+Changeling+the+Lost\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://wodindex.wikispaces.com/Complete+Changeling+the+Lost\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://wodindex.wikispaces.com/Complete+Changeling+the+Lost\" target=\"_blank\"> http://wodindex.wikispaces.com/Complete+Changeling+the+Lost </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> Not specifically Jester, but there's a few that could fit. Riddlemasters and Tricksters, Gameplayers and Muses.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-16T05:22:07-07:00","id":113980,"title":"","content":"I don't know that there's a specific Jester Kith out there, but the Author, Chatalaine, Dancer, or Minstrel kiths could all be used to play one. To create a jester-themed kith you'd probably want to start with one of those as a base. <br /> <br /> What sort of powers or effects were you looking for in this Jester? The kiths are effect-based, so if there's another kith that already does what you need, you could reflavor it as a jester pretty easily. Want someone who can evoke uncontrollable laughter with a joke? Look at tweaking the Nightsinger kith.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1168-hobbitguy1420","name":"HobbitGuy1420","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1168_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"332"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}